      "content": "i know, i know, my doctor is always so cautious. but a balanced diet takes forever to change and i'm literally in pain right now. 5 pills a day isn't even that much, it's only like 500mg total, which seems tiny compared to what people eat normally. if i just do it for a week to get through this rough patch, is it really gonna do that much damage to my kidneys? i just feel like i can't live like this without some quick relief.",
